  "description": "A lightweight, robust, flexible and extensible, type- and thread-safe C# framework, designed to facilitate dynamic data-driven testing in MSTest, NUnit or xUnit frameworks, by providing simple and intuitive ways to generate test cases at runtime with literal names.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
